Package: dockclaimR
Title: Assess Stability of Molecular Docking Prioritizations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Andrés",
           family = "Monreal Hernández",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "andres.monreal@ues.mx",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-1207-8597"))
Description: Provides transparent utilities for assessing whether an existing
    molecular docking prioritization is stable across prespecified scenarios.
    The package does not run docking engines and does not interpret docking
    scores as experimental binding or biological activity.
